Falsifies `designware_mobile_storage::proofs::a_card_is_brought_up_only_through_every_step`.

The defect: SD configuration skips `CMD16`, so a card comes back from `identify` without its
block length set to 512 bytes.

Expected to fail: `assert!(model.block_bytes_set)`.
